sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Owner
  participant M as More
  participant C as Customers
  participant T as Staff and Riders
  participant P as Prices and Settings
  participant A as My Account
  participant S as Server
  O->>M: 1: Open More
  O->>M: 2: Tap Customers
  M->>C: 3: Customer list, search, profile (orders, addresses, unpaid, borrowed)
  O->>M: 4: Tap Staff and Riders
  M->>T: 5: Accounts list
  O->>T: 6: Add account, edit, deactivate or reset password
  T->>S: 7: POST or PUT /api/staff
  O->>M: 8: Tap Prices and Settings
  M->>P: 9: Prices, tank limit, low-stock levels, station location, demo ride
  O->>P: 10: Edit and Save
  P->>S: 11: PUT /api/settings/...
  O->>M: 12: Tap Notifications
  M-->>O: 13: Alerts and Preferences (same as the bell)
  O->>M: 14: Tap My Account
  M->>A: 15: Profile, change password, log out
  O->>A: 16: Log out
  A-->>O: 17: Back to Welcome
